{
  "_comment": "BruceWorx workspaces (roadmap 13.4, step C2). Each workspace runs one FreeCAD workbench. A tab lists its groups; each group becomes one custom toolbar named '<Tab> · <Caption>' in that workbench, with 'more' commands in the caption menu only. A tab with \"toolbars\": \"workbench\" shows the workbench's own toolbars. 'replaces' are the workbench's stock toolbars that the groups take over. 'load' are the modules imported before a group's command is looked up (commands from other workbenches). A tab with \"requires\": \"<add-on folder>\" shows only while that add-on is loaded (SheetMetal, MOD-06).",
  "load": [
    "PartGui",
    "BOPTools:importAll",
    "BOPTools:addCommands",
    "PartDesignGui",
    "SketcherGui",
    "SurfaceGui",
    "MeshGui",
    "MeshPartGui",
    "SpreadsheetGui",
    "CommandCreateAssembly",
    "CommandInsertLink",
    "CommandInsertNewPart",
    "CommandCreateJoint",
    "CommandSolveAssembly",
    "CommandCreateView",
    "CommandCreateSimulation",
    "CommandCreateBom",
    "ExtrudedCutout",
